1
00:00:00,091 --> 00:00:02,591
David Headley is serving thirty-five years

2
00:00:02,617 --> 00:00:04,609
in an undisclosed US prison.

3
00:00:05,026 --> 00:00:07,812
In 2018 there were reports that fellow

4
00:00:07,826 --> 00:00:09,076
inmates attacked him.

5
00:00:09,492 --> 00:00:11,732
India has asked again and again to

6
00:00:11,745 --> 00:00:13,086
question him in person.

7
00:00:13,516 --> 00:00:16,536
When Rana was flown to Delhi in 2025,

8
00:00:16,862 --> 00:00:18,828
it reportedly asked once more.

9
00:00:20,102 --> 00:00:21,639
He has stayed in America.

10
00:00:22,794 --> 00:00:25,216
The lesson of his story isn't that one man

11
00:00:25,229 --> 00:00:26,271
fooled everyone.

12
00:00:26,661 --> 00:00:28,042
The warnings were real.

13
00:00:28,445 --> 00:00:30,763
They came from the people closest to him.

14
00:00:31,206 --> 00:00:33,315
But the agencies built to catch a man like

15
00:00:33,328 --> 00:00:35,463
him were each watching one thing — drugs,

16
00:00:35,489 --> 00:00:36,779
or spies, or terror.

17
00:00:38,016 --> 00:00:39,657
Never all three at once.

18
00:00:40,843 --> 00:00:42,575
He was the seam between them.

19
00:00:43,851 --> 00:00:46,169
And a seam is exactly where things come

20
00:00:46,182 --> 00:00:46,755
apart.

